--TEST--
each key written in an anonymous object is a token of its own, so an editor colours it as a property, `rule:types/anonymous-object`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $point = {x: 1, y: 2};
echo $point->x, "\n";
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
2:5+6 variable
2:15+1 property
2:21+1 property
3:6+6 variable
3:14+1 property
